WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:07.000
Welcome aboard, I'm Erik. Merchants guess their Black Friday prices, and they leave money on the table.

2
00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:11.867
Price too low, and they sell out. Too high, and buyers go somewhere else.

3
00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:15.733
Your first job is the spec for our price recommender.

4
00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:25.633
A price rule. The revenue formula, at three price points. Backup rules for odd products. And an accuracy bar the model has to clear.

5
00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:32.467
It has to beat last week's baseline on every slice. Jenna is your coach. Ask me anything.
